ffirm":0,"cut":0}],"ai_disruption":[0,0,0,0.0]},"move":{"r1":0.0167,"r5":0.0163,"r1_spy":-0.007,"r5_spy":-0.0097,"r1_sector":0.0022,"r5_sector":-0.0103,"etf":"XLF"}}],"quotes":[{"c":"KKR 2022 Q1","e":"kkr","d":"2022-05-03","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Robert Lewin","x":"This portfolio is performing extremely well, and we believe has many of the right attributes to outperform if we go through a period of volatility and real inflation, including having real pricing power.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"KKR 2022 Q1","e":"kkr","d":"2022-05-03","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Scott Nuttall","x":"So we've been quite focused on investing in businesses all around the world that have real pricing power.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"KKR 2024 Q3","e":"kkr","d":"2024-10-24","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Rob Lewin","x":"And third are themes in the Cloud AI storage and data center space.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"KKR 2024 Q3","e":"kkr","d":"2024-10-24","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Patrick Davitt","x":"We usually take the view that elections don't matter much either way, but one looming big change that could come this time is clearly tariffs on markets appear to be pricing that in to some extent.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"KKR 2024 Q3","e":"kkr","d":"2024-10-24","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Patrick Davitt","x":"So aside from inflation and rate impacts, do you have any initial thoughts on how the existing portfolio could be negatively or even positively impacted by tariffs and or a trade war?","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"KKR 2024 Q4","e":"kkr","d":"2025-02-04","l":"ai_spend","r":"analyst","s":"Craig Larson","x":"And second and more specific to the data center business, with the growth in overall data generation, cloud and AI, there's just a need for much more compute.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"KKR 2024 Q4","e":"kkr","d":"2025-02-04","l":"ai_spend","r":"analyst","s":"Craig Larson","x":"And in our more recent examples, investments, rather, growth driven by cloud, not AI, again, has been really the critical driver.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"KKR 2024 Q4","e":"kkr","d":"2025-02-04","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Robert Lewin","x":"…these additional purchases alongside continued strong performance across our portfolio, we are increasing our guidance for Strategic Holdings operating earnings that we introduced roughly a year ago by $50 million in 2026 to $350 plus million and by $100 million in each of 2028 and 2030 to…","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"KKR 2025 Q1","e":"kkr","d":"2025-05-01","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Robert Lewin","x":"The first is the impact of tariffs on our existing portfolio.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"KKR 2025 Q1","e":"kkr","d":"2025-05-01","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Robert Lewin","x":"As a starting point, it is important to remember that tariffs and supply chain diversification and resilience have been front-of-mind topics for our investment, public affairs, and macro teams dating back to the global pandemic.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"KKR 2025 Q2","e":"kkr","d":"2025-07-31","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Scott Nuttall","x":"We're spending a lot of time with young companies in the AI space and their founders and helping to connect dots between what they're building and how an alternative asset management firm actually functions.","url":"https://ir.kkr.com/media/document/b91413cf-ccac-4d44-9ff2-120a950aa390/assets/KKR_Q225_Earnings_Transcript.pdf"},{"c":"KKR 2025 Q4","e":"kkr","d":"2026-02-05","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Scott Nuttall","x":"It means that we have to continue to invest behind growth and where AI can be an important driver of growth.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/05/kkr-kkr-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"KKR 2025 Q4","e":"kkr","d":"2026-02-05","l":"ai_spend","r":"analyst","s":"Michael Cyprys","x":"If you could talk about how that's evolving, what sort of opportunities and benefits have you harnessed from that, and how you've also your portfolio construction around investing around the AI infrastructure layer and the benefits there.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/05/kkr-kkr-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"KKR 2025 Q4","e":"kkr","d":"2026-02-05","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Scott Nuttall","x":"One was tariffs and one was AI.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/05/kkr-kkr-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"KKR 2025 Q4","e":"kkr","d":"2026-02-05","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Scott Nuttall","x":"On the tariff front, it's pretty straightforward.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/05/kkr-kkr-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"KKR 2025 Q4","e":"kkr","d":"2026-02-05","l":"ai_disruption","r":"management","s":"Scott Nuttall","x":"We've been focused on AI-driven competition and disruption risk for the last several years.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/05/kkr-kkr-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"KKR 2026 Q1","e":"kkr","d":"2026-05-05","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Craig Larson","x":"Now from an investing standpoint, AI, we look at both from a diligence lens as well as from a value creation perspective.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/05/kkr-kkr-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"KKR 2026 Q1","e":"kkr","d":"2026-05-05","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Craig Larson","x":"That's both with a focus on whether that's revenue or EBITDA growth, whether that's AI exposure, whether that is the investment teams and the approach to AI from a defensive and an offensive standpoint.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/05/kkr-kkr-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"KKR 2026 Q1","e":"kkr","d":"2026-05-05","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Robert Lewin","x":"But we also do expect a slowdown in Q2, consistent with what we saw after the tariff announcements last year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/05/kkr-kkr-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"KKR 2026 Q1","e":"kkr","d":"2026-05-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Craig Larson","x":"Look, we're focused on AI, how it affects margins, pricing power, workflow relevance and cash flow resilience.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/05/kkr-kkr-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"KKR 2026 Q1","e":"kkr","d":"2026-05-05","l":"ai_disruption","r":"analyst","s":"Steven Chubak","x":"It's an area that's viewed as being more at risk of AI disintermediation.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/05/kkr-kkr-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"KKR 2026 Q1","e":"kkr","d":"2026-05-05","l":"ai_disruption","r":"analyst","s":"Patrick Davitt","x":"And more specifically, have you done a scrub to identify how exposed those positions are to potential AI disintermediation of things like India outsourcing?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/05/kkr-kkr-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"KKR 2026 Q2","e":"kkr","d":"2026-07-30","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Robert Lewin","x":"We are in the midst of a global CapEx cycle, AI, digital and energy infrastructure, defense, industrial, so massive needs here for capital on a global basis, which makes our industry increasingly relevant.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earning